# Auth is now cookie-based; no API key in the browser.

# Note: the dashboard calls the API at the relative path "/api" (same origin),
# so no API base URL is needed. The webhook endpoint is configured in the app
# (Settings → Connection), not via env.

# --- Meetsy single-login round-trip ---
# Exact-origin allowlist for the `?redirect=` param on /login. A user sent from
# Meetsy ("/login?redirect=<meetsy-url>") is returned there after sign-in ONLY if
# the redirect URL's origin equals this value (open-redirect protection); anything
# else falls back to /overview. This is a BUILD-TIME Vite var (baked at build,
# read via import.meta.env) — must be set before `vite build`, not at runtime.
# Dev:  http://localhost:3001
# Prod: https://meetsy.<your-domain>
VITE_MEETSY_WEB_ORIGIN=
